                        <li class="pl-1.5 border-l-2 border-amber-500/50">
                            <strong class="text-amber-300">First:</strong> <span class="italic text-amber-100">"The towering giant of biology."</span>
                        </li>
                        <li class="pl-1.5 border-l-2 border-amber-500/50">
